# The generator tests compare golden files byte-for-byte against what Konstruktor
# writes, and Konstruktor always writes LF. Git for Windows checks out with CRLF by
# default (`core.autocrlf=true`), which turned every one of those comparisons red on
# the Windows CI runner. Nothing in this repository is a Windows-native file, so the
# whole tree is normalised rather than just the fixtures.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Left alone regardless of what content detection makes of them.
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
